    "label_rule": "signature, time, inclusion, witness_count, policy, anchors and determination are binary: 1 only when checked and passed, 0 when absent, failed or unverifiable; a failed check never pays. witness_count is 1 only for a met quorum, and then tier is 0.5 or 1; policy is 1 only when every result passed and traced to a registered citation; anchors is 1 only when every external anchor has a verified resolution; ratification is 0 unless witness_count is 1. missing counts the five zero verification dimensions (signature, time, inclusion, witness, determination). z = -3.20 + 1.80*signature + 0.90*time + 0.70*inclusion + 1.10*witness_count + 0.55*witness_tier + 0.70*policy + 0.50*ratification + 0.35*anchors + 0.80*determination - 0.90*missing; label ~ Bernoulli(sigmoid(z)) with a seeded PRNG."
